<title>USA: Imatron ships 100th Ultrafast scanner.</title>
<headline>Imatron ships 100th Ultrafast scanner.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imatron Inc said Wednesday it has shipped its 99th and 100th Ultrafast CT scanners to medical facilities in South Korea and China.</p>
<p>The total value of these two sales exceeds $4 million.</p>
<p>&quot;These two shipments reflect our strategy of specifically targeting the Asia Pacific market in order to increase sales of Ultrafast CT scanners,&quot; Lewis Meyer, chief executive officer said in a statement.</p>
</text>
